{"description":"We are from mexico","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/Logo_circular_simple_negro.2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.png","summary":"My team and I developed a website that follows our challenge indications, we chose Guaymas, a city in the state of Sonora, Mexico (its the city we live in). We used data from NASA's NISAR on our website and we chose Guaymas because official local planning documents identify environmental challenges connected to water, urban development, and coastal management.","details":"<p>We used Netlify to make our project, it uses real NISAR data from NASA, and it shows why we focus on Guaymas</p>","dataRefs":[["NASA — NISAR mission","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/nisar/"],["NASA — Mission overview","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/nisar/"],["NASA — Mission concept","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/nisar/mission-concept/"],["NISAR_L2_PR_GCOV_033_139_D_092_4005_DHDH_A_20261021T203740_20261021T203818_P05023_N_F_J_001","https://urs.earthdata.nasa.gov/oauth/authorize?client_id=qpa3q_b7OJ32gGjwA9DxHg&response_type=code&redirect_uri=https://nisar.asf.earthdatacloud.nasa.gov/login&state=%2FNISAR%2FNISAR_L2_GCOV_PROVISIONAL_V1%2FNISAR_L2_PR_GCOV_033_139_D_092_4005_DHDH_A_20261021T203740_20261021T203818_P05023_N_F_J_001%2FNISAR_L2_PR_GCOV_033_139_D_092_4005_DHDH_A_20261021T203740_20261021T203818_P05023_N_F_J_001.h5"]],"projectRefs":[["Guaymas municipal planning / territorial ordering document","https://smt.guaymas.gob.mx/archivo/2026/01/ID31148-AG71-FG1-IGA-DCU-FE01-2026-FORMATO--DEL-PLAN%2C-PROGRAMA-DE-ORDENAMIENTO-TERRITORIAL-4TO-TRIMESTRE-2025.PDF"],["Municipal report, Somos Guaymas","https://guaymas.gob.mx/assets/documents/SOMOS_GUAYMAS_PRIMER_INFORME.pdf"],["Guaymas Municipal Development Plan 2013–2015","https://archivos.guaymas.gob.mx/archivos/Presidencia/PLAN%20MUNICIPAL%20DE%20DESARROLLO%202013-2015.pdf"]],"members":[{"name":"Hector Carlos","country":"Mexico","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/ima